      "description": "The goWatch app for GoPro® cameras allows you to remote control your GoPro® cameras directly from your Apple Watch.\n\nDemo video: https://youtu.be/FjfV_0xoDIw\n\n### Compatible GoPro® cameras:\nGoPro® Hero 5 Black Edition, GoPro® Hero 5 Session, GoPro® Hero 6 Black Edition, GoPro® Hero 7 White/Silver/Black Edition, GoPro® Hero13 Black, Hero12 Black, Hero11 Black, Hero10 Black, Hero9 Black, and Hero8 Black, Mission 1 Pro, GoPro® Hero 11 Mini, GoPro® Max, Max 2 360°, and GoPro® Fusion 360° cameras.\n\n### IMPORTANT:\nIf you do not find the app after purchase on your watch: Please install the app with the App Store app on your watch (not on the iPhone!).\n\n### Features:\n- Start/stop recording\n- Power off the camera\n- Tag moment\n- Change the camera mode (photo, video, multi-shot) and presets (*new*)\n- Locate the camera\n- Show camera information (battery level, free space, number of videos and images, ...)\n- *New*: Show the last camera state (connected, recording) on the watch front screen (camera status complication).\n- *New*: Keep camera connection alive while app is in background.\n- *New*: Capture countdown (3/5/10/15/20 s).\n\n### Disclaimer\nThis product and/or service is not affiliated with, endorsed by or in any way associated with GoPro Inc. or its products and services. GoPro, HERO and their respective logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of GoPro, Inc",
